{"4165930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dawn of the Dying", "steam_appid": 4165930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Dawn is Not a Beginning. It's a Reminder.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new day is not a gift; it's a countdown. The world didn't end in a single cataclysm—it's ending slowly, painfully, with every rising sun. This is the <strong>Dawn of the Dying</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165930/extras/c41ca442dc9a125214eb98d9c1aef908.poster.avif?t=1772749149\" width=800 height=311 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165930/extras/c41ca442dc9a125214eb98d9c1aef908.webm?t=1772749149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a breathtakingly brutal open world where hope is as scarce as ammo. Scavenge the ruins of a fallen civilization, fending off not just the shambling dead, but the savage wildlife that has reclaimed the land, and the ruthless soldiers who now rule its ashes. Build, craft, and fight for every breath with your friends in a world where every dawn could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165930/extras/00720303f8250d5ab4190b9ec25d82b9.poster.avif?t=1772749149\" width=1170 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165930/extras/00720303f8250d5ab4190b9ec25d82b9.webm?t=1772749149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165930/extras/00720303f8250d5ab4190b9ec25d82b9.mp4?t=1772749149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World in Its Death Throes:</strong> Explore a vast, diverse landscape, from silent, overgrown forests to plague-ridden urban centers, all under a sun that illuminates your struggle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Your Will to Live:</strong> Forge weapons, tools, and fortifications from the scraps of the old world. Your <strong>resourcefulness</strong> is your greatest weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a Last Refuge:</strong> Construct a fortified sanctuary against the horrors of the night. Design and defend your base from relentless zombie hordes, mutated beasts, and the organized assaults of the <strong>Ashen Legion</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive Together in PVE:</strong> Band together with friends in a purely cooperative struggle for survival. Face the combined threats of the infected, the wilds, and the fanatical <strong>Ashen Legion</strong> in a world designed to be conquered as a team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Arsenal Forged in Desperation:</strong> Wield everything from makeshift axes and crossbows to high-caliber military rifles. Find, modify, and master the tools of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Unforgiving Cycle:</strong> Manage your hunger, thirst, and stamina in a world that is actively trying to kill you. Every day is a new challenge, a new <strong>Dawn of the Dying</strong>.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Dawn is Not a Beginning. It's a Reminder.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new day is not a gift; it's a countdown. The world didn't end in a single cataclysm—it's ending slowly, painfully, with every rising sun. This is the <strong>Dawn of the Dying</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165930/extras/c41ca442dc9a125214eb98d9c1aef908.poster.avif?t=1772749149\" width=800 height=311 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165930/extras/c41ca442dc9a125214eb98d9c1aef908.webm?t=1772749149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a breathtakingly brutal open world where hope is as scarce as ammo. Scavenge the ruins of a fallen civilization, fending off not just the shambling dead, but the savage wildlife that has reclaimed the land, and the ruthless soldiers who now rule its ashes. Build, craft, and fight for every breath with your friends in a world where every dawn could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165930/extras/00720303f8250d5ab4190b9ec25d82b9.poster.avif?t=1772749149\" width=1170 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165930/extras/00720303f8250d5ab4190b9ec25d82b9.webm?t=1772749149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165930/extras/00720303f8250d5ab4190b9ec25d82b9.mp4?t=1772749149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World in Its Death Throes:</strong> Explore a vast, diverse landscape, from silent, overgrown forests to plague-ridden urban centers, all under a sun that illuminates your struggle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Your Will to Live:</strong> Forge weapons, tools, and fortifications from the scraps of the old world. Your <strong>resourcefulness</strong> is your greatest weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a Last Refuge:</strong> Construct a fortified sanctuary against the horrors of the night. Design and defend your base from relentless zombie hordes, mutated beasts, and the organized assaults of the <strong>Ashen Legion</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive Together in PVE:</strong> Band together with friends in a purely cooperative struggle for survival. Face the combined threats of the infected, the wilds, and the fanatical <strong>Ashen Legion</strong> in a world designed to be conquered as a team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Arsenal Forged in Desperation:</strong> Wield everything from makeshift axes and crossbows to high-caliber military rifles. Find, modify, and master the tools of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Unforgiving Cycle:</strong> Manage your hunger, thirst, and stamina in a world that is actively trying to kill you. Every day is a new challenge, a new <strong>Dawn of the Dying</strong>.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "In a brutal open world, standing still means death. Explore together in a co-op survival FPS where crafting, building, and fighting with friends is the only way forward.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165930/570e9c612fbad36b23238fe39aa894c679f7e572/header.jpg?t=1772749149", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165930/ba72bfb801f0b9a910c378b09f9759853e4a0cc7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772749149", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4165930/ba72bfb801f0b9a910